{"study_accession":"PRJNA692373","secondary_study_accession":"SRP301909","title":"RNA-seq of seven altitude-adapted female speed skaters before and after exercise","description":"Whole blood samples were collected from seven elite female skaters on the peak of altitude adaptation (day 18), before and after ~ 1h long exercise. Samples were globin-depleted and polyA-selected, converted to cDNA, and sequenced using Illumina paired-end reads (12-40M reads). Overall design: We performed a whole transcriptome sequencing analysis of peripheral blood in seven altitude-adapted elite speed skaters, before and after ~ 1h long exercise. Reads were aligned to genome and transcriptome using STAR, and quantified using RSEM. Gene expression and enrichment was analyzed in R using DESeq2. Pathway analysis was done using the Molecular Signatures Database (MsigDB) via MsigDB website.","pubmed":"35456380","geo_series":"","n_samples":14,"study_labels":[],"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN17321139","study_accession":"PRJNA692373","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"Skater 6 - before exercise","description":"Skater 6 - before exercise","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM5022479","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2021-07-20","attributes":[["source_name","whole blood (globin-depleted)"],["tissue","whole blood (globin-depleted)"],["timepoint","before exercise"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR13442905","experiment_accession":"SRX9856320","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Illumina HiSeq 4000","read_count":42600787,"base_count":11281694424,"first_public":"2021-07-20","experiment_title":"Illumina HiSeq 4000 sequencing: GSM5022479: Skater 6 - before exercise Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN17321140","study_accession":"PRJNA692373","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"Skater 4 - after exercise","description":"Skater 4 - after exercise","sex":"","geo_sampl